cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use these scripts, please cite the release as below."
title: "FASTA Utilities: scripts for extracting, combining, renaming, splitting and trimming mitogenome FASTA files"
abstract: "Five Python scripts (standard library only) for preparing mitogenome FASTA files for alignment: mito_gene_extractor extracts one FASTA file per gene using a MITOS2 annotation; Concatenate_fasta_files combines FASTA files into one multi-FASTA file; ConvertTextToFasta renames FASTA files saved as .txt after checking they are FASTA; split_major_fastas splits one-file-per-gene FASTA files into per-specimen files; trim_fasta_trailing_whitespace removes trailing whitespace from FASTA files."
type: software
